        "original_id": "d2417939-7745-5c45-a88f-e68961ef0f94",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stephen Quay, Timothy Quay, Alexandra Elizabeth Shiva\n- Roles: twin brothers, film producer, director\n- Awards: Drama Desk Award for Outstanding Set Design\n- Works: The Chairs, Bombay Eunuch, How to Dance in Ohio\n- Events: Sundance Film Festival, US Documentary Competition\n\nFacts:\n- Stephen Quay and Timothy Quay were born on June 17, 1947.\n- Stephen Quay and Timothy Quay are American identical twin brothers known as the Brothers Quay or Quay Brothers.\n- Alexandra Elizabeth Shiva is an American film producer and director.\n- Alexandra Elizabeth Shiva made the award-winning 2001 film Bombay Eunuch.\n- In 1998, Stephen Quay and Timothy Quay received the Drama Desk Award for Outstanding Set Design for their work on the play The Chairs.\n- In 2015, Alexandra Elizabeth Shiva showed How to Dance in Ohio at the Sundance Film Festival in the US Documentary Competition.",
